{"command":"$patterns = @('快速开始','规则链路','冲突裁决','必要流程','Git 同步范围','核心原则','先想后做','只问一个问题','工作流程','规则链路','冲突裁决','MUST','沟通与交互','任务执行','文件与目录操作','代码生成与质量','六、技能调用','流程管控','request-analyzer','brainstorming','test-driven-development','requesting-code-review','CONVENTIONS.md');
$files = @('AGENTS.md','core/AGENT.md','core/RULES.md','core/CONVENTIONS.md');
foreach ($f in $files) {
  "`n=== $f ===";
  Select-String -Path $f -Pattern $patterns -SimpleMatch -Encoding UTF8 | ForEach-Object { "{0}:{1}: {2}" -f $_.Path, $_.LineNumber, $_.Line.Trim() }
}"}
